---
// Booking.astro
---

<section class="booking-section" id="rezerwacja">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="booking-grid">
      
      <!-- LEWA KOLUMNA: Informacje -->
      <div class="booking-info">
        <span class="kicker">ZACZNIJMY OD SPOTKANIA</span>
        <h2>Twój ogród.<br>Ustalmy pierwszy krok.</h2>
        
        <div class="contact-details">
          <a href="tel:+48516753132" class="phone">123 456 789 ↗</a>
          <a href="mailto:biurozielonezielone@gmail.com" class="email">alejazda@gmail.com</a>
          
          <address class="address">
            Grojec i okolice<br>
            ul. Szarotki 1A, 31-347 Grojec
          </address>
        </div>

        <div class="preparation-box">
          <h3>Przygotuj na spotkanie</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Zdjęcia i przybliżone wymiary działki.</li>
            <li>Listę planowanych prac lub projekt.</li>
            <li>Informacje o wodzie, instalacjach i wjeździe.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PRAWA KOLUMNA: Formularz / Kalendarz -->
      <div class="booking-form-wrapper">
        <p class="form-disclaimer">
          Wybierz termin w kalendarzu poniżej. Wizja lokalna na działce z omówieniem zakresu i wyceny: <strong>199,99 PLN brutto</strong>. Warunki sprawdź podczas rezerwacji.
        </p>
        
        <div class="form-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="dot"></span>
            <span>Kalendarz spotkań</span>
          </div>

          <form id="booking-form" class="booking-form" action="/api/rezerwacja" method="POST">
            <!-- W nagłówku formularza (np. na mobilkach przycisk też może być) -->
            <div class="form-hero">
              <div class="hero-bar">Zarezerwuj termin</div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-section">
              <h4 class="section-title">Podstawowe informacje</h4>
              
              <div class="input-group">
                <label for="service">Wybierz usługę *</label>
                <div class="select-wrapper">
                  <select id="service" name="service" required>
                    <option value="wycena">Spotkanie - Wycena - konsultacja</option>
                    <option value="projekt">Omówienie projektu</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Zintegrowane pole E-mail ze ścisłą weryfikacją HTML5 -->
              <div class="input-group">
                <label for="email">Adres e-mail * (na ten adres wyślemy potwierdzenie)</label>
                <input 
                  type="email" 
                  id="email" 
                  name="email" 
                  placeholder="np. jan.kowalski@gmail.com" 
                  required 
                  pattern="[a-z0-9._%+\\-]+@[a-z0-9.\\-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}$"
                  title="Podaj prawidłowy adres e-mail, np. nazwa@domena.pl"
                />
                <span class="error-msg">Wprowadź poprawny adres e-mail!</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-section">
              <h4 class="section-title">Termin</h4>
              
              <!-- MOCKUP KALENDARZA (Zastąp systemem rezerwacji lub zostaw jako UI do własnego backendu) -->
              <div class="calendar-widget">
                <div class="calendar-header">
                  <button type="button" class="cal-nav">&lt;</button>
                  <strong>Listopad 2026</strong>
                  <button type="button" class="cal-nav">&gt;</button>
                </div>
                <div class="calendar-grid">
                  <div class="day-name">Pn.</div>
                  <div class="day-name">Wt.</div>
                  <div class="day-name">Śr.</div>
                  <div class="day-name">Cz.</div>
                  <div class="day-name">Pt.</div>
                  <div class="day-name">So.</div>
                  <div class="day-name">Nd.</div>
                  
                  <!-- Puste dni -->
                  <div class="day empty"></div><div class="day empty"></div><div class="day empty"></div>
                  <div class="day empty"></div><div class="day empty"></div><div class="day empty"></div>
                  <div class="day disabled">1</div>
                  
                  <div class="day disabled">2</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">3</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">4</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">5</div>
                  <div class="day available">6</div>
                  <div class="day available">7</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">8</div>
                  
                  <div class="day available">9</div>
                  <div class="day available">10</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">11</div>
                  <div class="day available">12</div>
                  <div class="day available">13</div>
                  <div class="day available">14</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">15</div>
                  
                  <div class="day available">16</div>
                  <div class="day available">17</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">18</div>
                  <div class="day available">19</div>
                  <div class="day available">20</div>
                  <div class="day available">21</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">22</div>
                  
                  <div class="day available selected">23</div>
                  <div class="day available">24</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">25</div>
                  <div class="day available">26</div>
                  <div class="day available">27</div>
                  <div class="day available">28</div>
                  <div class="day disabled">29</div>
                  
                  <div class="day available">30</div>
                </div>
                <!-- Ukryty input do przechowywania wybranej daty -->
                <input type="hidden" id="selected-date" name="date" value="2026-11-23" required />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-section">
              <h4 class="section-title">Dodatkowe informacje</h4>
              
              <div class="input-group">
                <label for="address">Adres *</label>
                <input type="text" id="address" name="address" required />
              </div>
              
              <div class="address-row">
                <div class="input-group">
                  <label for="zip">Kod pocztowy *</label>
                  <input type="text" id="zip" name="zip" required pattern="[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{3}" placeholder="00-000" />
                </div>
                <div class="input-group">
                  <label for="city">Miejscowość *</label>
                  <input type="text" id="city" name="city" required />
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <span class="required-note">* pola wymagane</span>
            </div>

            <div class="form-footer">
              <div class="price-box">
                Cena: <strong>199,99 zł</strong>
              </div>
              <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Przejdź do podsumowania &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </form>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Skrypt obsługujący UI kalendarza i weryfikację e-mail -->
<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    // Prosta logika wyboru dni w kalendarzu (tylko UI)
    const days = document.querySelectorAll('.day.available');
    const dateInput = document.getElementById('selected-date') as HTMLInputElement;
    
days.forEach(day => {
      // Zmieniliśmy 'function()' na nowoczesną funkcję strzałkową '() =>'
      day.addEventListener('click', () => {
        // 1. Usuń klasę selected ze wszystkich
        days.forEach(d => d.classList.remove('selected'));
        
        // 2. Dodaj do klikniętego (zamiast 'this' używamy 'day')
        day.classList.add('selected');
        
        // 3. Zaktualizuj ukryty input
        if (dateInput) {
          dateInput.value = `2026-11-${day.textContent?.trim().padStart(2, '0')}`;
        }
      });
    });

    // Walidacja maila przy próbie wysłania
    const form = document.getElementById('booking-form') as HTMLFormElement;
    form?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      
      const emailInput = document.getElementById('email') as HTMLInputElement;
      if (!emailInput.validity.valid) {
        emailInput.classList.add('invalid');
        return; // Zatrzymujemy wysyłkę jeśli mail jest zły
      }
      
      // Jeśli wszystko ok, tutaj poszedłby fetch() do Google Sheets API
      alert('Formularz prawidłowy! Trwa wysyłanie... (Wepnij tu integrację z API)');
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  /* Zmienne i ogólny układ */
  .booking-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    /* Delikatne, miętowo-zielone tło inspirowane projektem */
    background-color: #eef6f1; 
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .booking-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* --- LEWA KOLUMNA --- */
  .booking-info {
    position: sticky;
    top: 40px;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #86b942; /* Nasz firmowy jasnozielony */
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .booking-info h2 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: #153c24; /* Firmowy ciemnozielony */
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .contact-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .phone {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #153c24;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .phone:hover { color: #86b942; }

  .email {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #374151;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .email:hover { color: #86b942; }

  .address {
    font-style: normal;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .preparation-box {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .preparation-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #153c24;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .preparation-box ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .preparation-box li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #4b5563;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .preparation-box li::before {
    content: '•';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: #86b942;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  /* --- PRAWA KOLUMNA --- */
  .form-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .form-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .card-header {
    padding: 16px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .card-header .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: #86b942;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .booking-form {
    padding: 30px;
  }

  .hero-bar {
    background-color: #86b942; /* Kolorystycznie dopasowany pasek */
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .form-section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .input-group {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .input-group label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .input-group input,
  .input-group select {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .input-group input:focus,
  .input-group select:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #86b942;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(134, 185, 66, 0.1);
  }

  /* Style dla błędu maila */
  input:invalid:not(:placeholder-shown) {
    border-color: #ef4444;
  }
  .error-msg {
    display: none;
    color: #ef4444;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  input:invalid:not(:placeholder-shown) + .error-msg {
    display: block;
  }

  .select-wrapper {
    position: relative;
  }
  
  .address-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .required-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    display: block;
    margin-top: -10px;
  }

  /* --- KALENDARZ UI --- */
  .calendar-widget {
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #fafaf9;
  }

  .calendar-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .calendar-header strong {
    color: #153c24;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .cal-nav {
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 4px;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #374151;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .cal-nav:hover { background: #f3f4f6; }

  .calendar-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
    gap: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .day-name {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .day {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .day.empty { background: transparent; }
  
  .day.disabled {
    color: #9ca3af;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .day.available {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    color: #86b942;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .day.available:hover {
    border-color: #86b942;
    background: #f0fdf4;
  }

  .day.available.selected {
    background: #86b942;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: #86b942;
  }

  /* --- STOPKA FORMULARZA --- */
  .form-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
    margin-top: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .price-box {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .price-box strong {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .submit-btn {
    background-color: #153c24;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s;
  }

  .submit-btn:hover {
    background-color: #2d6641;
  }

  /* --- RESPONSYWNOŚĆ --- */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .booking-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .booking-info {
      position: static;
    }
    .booking-info h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .form-disclaimer {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .booking-form { padding: 20px; }
    .address-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-footer { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>